{"id":"e2311665721b3454","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-logical-consequence.md","title":"语义后承与有效性","display":"df-logical-consequence — 语义后承与有效性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-logical-consequence","aliases":["43-df-logical-consequence"],"display":"df-logical-consequence — 语义后承与有效性","depends_on":["[[43-df-satisfaction]]","[[43-df-sentence]]","[[43-df-structure]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-logical-consequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-logical-consequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logical-consequence — 语义后承与有效性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3238d7fca6c27a3f\" href=\"?note=3238d7fca6c27a3f\" title=\"43-df-satisfaction\">43-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1be181e56e937ecb\" href=\"?note=1be181e56e937ecb\" title=\"43-df-sentence\">43-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5c55ddf2aa11f80\" href=\"?note=f5c55ddf2aa11f80\" title=\"43-df-structure\">43-df-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\">\\(L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_L\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_L\\)</span>。对结构的量化在集合论元层进行，固定同一语言L。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\models_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak A\\ \\Bigl(\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\ (\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi)\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi\\models_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak A\\ \\Bigl(\\operatorname{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,L)\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\ (\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi)\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\models\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\Phi\\models_L\\varphi,\\qquad\\models_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\models_L\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi\\models\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\Phi\\models_L\\varphi,\\qquad\\models_L\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\varnothing\\models_L\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>旧文第一个后承式未限制为L结构；现在前两节绑定结构参数。无语言歧义时允许省略L。</p>\n<p>来源：本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。 此项为支撑原有形式化的一阶逻辑基础，非声称原书有独立同名定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"